<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Integrated Device.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Integrated Device.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said it cut its 1997 operating earnings estimate for Integrated Device Technology Inc to a loss of $0.09 a share. The previous estimate was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- said it reiterated its neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- After the market closed Thursday, Integrated Device posted a third quarter loss of $0.55 a share, compared to earnings a year ago of $0.42 on a fully-diluted basis.</p>
<p>-- Integrated Device was off two to 11-3/4 at midday.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
